				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bkardell.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:httl4meeb5mx5767hike2t4q/bafkreiduzv2xwkhuudncicmqday73trtdnqedafwezzlojhio57wu4jhwi"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T20:22:22.567Z",
			"content": "<p>I can tell you, as someone on the committee, that it seems a so difficult to manage what people read into all of this.  A lot of people think we should focus exclusively on the more mature, rough edges, and not new stuff - and lot of other people think it should include none of that.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:httl4meeb5mx5767hike2t4q/app.bsky.feed.post/3lk2f3mlse22m",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xf7krjtyhvmoqjyl4dgiafey/app.bsky.feed.post/3lk2eqcp7as2j",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bkardell.com/post/3lk2f3mlse22m",
			"author": {
				"name": "Brian Kardell",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bkardell.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:httl4meeb5mx5767hike2t4q/bafkreiduzv2xwkhuudncicmqday73trtdnqedafwezzlojhio57wu4jhwi"
			},
			"date": "2025-03-10T20:24:42.569Z",
			"content": "<p>If you haven't heard it, <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:widt5upyy6uevzv2n3ehtred\">@meyerweb.com</a> and I talk about how it works a bit and why it's a bit opaque.  If it helps at all.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.igalia.com/chats/interopify\">www.igalia.com/chats/intero...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
